<title>USA: InVision wins $6.07 mln order.</title>
<headline>InVision wins $6.07 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>FOSTER CITY, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>InVision Technologies Inc on Wednesday said the French aviation authority has exercised an option to acquire seven CTX 5000 explosive detection units for $6.07 million to use in French airports.</p>
<p>The agency, the French Direction Generale de L'Aviation Civile, purchased five units in October. The additional order brings the total contract value up to $10.67 million.</p>
<p>The units are scheduled to be shipped over the next 12 months.</p>
</text>
